    "description": "One line in the \"More from EDACrux\" section of the empty-canvas (welcome) screen, describing LintCrux to someone using WaveCrux. Written from THIS product's point of view on purpose — what LintCrux does for a WaveCrux user is not what it does for a user of another product — so do not reuse another repository's wording. Keep it to roughly one short sentence plus one more; the row wraps but is not a paragraph. Product names are never translated."
  },
  "emptyCanvasPeerSimCrux": "このトレースを出力したテストベンチを実行。リグレッションを起動し、失敗をここで開く。",
